  "meta": {
    "name": "Expression Rose",
    "createdAt": "2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z",
    "modifiedAt": "2026-10-03T00:00:00.000Z"
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "ex_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -274
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Expression — type the maths\n\nEach formula's names become pins (u, petals). Fed a spread of 900 values, a formula runs once per value. vec2(…) builds positions, hsl(…) colours, and t is the clock.\n\nEdit a formula on its node: a typo shows its error on the node.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 210
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Expression — type the maths\n\nEach formula's names become pins (u, petals). Fed a spread of 900 values, a formula runs once per value. vec2(…) builds positions, hsl(…) colours, and t is the clock.\n\nEdit a formula on its node: a typo shows its error on the node.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 210
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ex_u",
      "defType": "spread/linear",
      "position": {
        "x": 26,
        "y": 224
      },
      "params": {
        "from": 0,
        "to": 1,
        "count": 900
      },
      "portValues": {
        "from": 0,
        "to": 1,
        "count": 900
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ex_petals",
      "defType": "io/slider",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 79
      },
      "params": {
        "value": 7,
        "min": 1,
        "max": 12,
        "step": 1
      },
      "portValues": {
        "value": 7,
        "min": 1,
        "max": 12,
        "step": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ex_pos",
      "defType": "math/expression",
      "position": {
        "x": 289,
        "y": 0
      },
      "params": {
        "expr": "vec2(cos(u * tau), sin(u * tau)) * (50 + 170 * abs(cos(petals / 2 * u * tau + t / 3)))"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ex_col",
      "defType": "math/expression",
      "position": {
        "x": 289,
        "y": 339
      },
      "params": {
        "expr": "hsl(fract(u * 2 + t / 20), 0.75, 0.62)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ex_size",
      "defType": "math/expression",
      "position": {
        "x": 289,
        "y": 186
      },
      "params": {
        "expr": "1.5 + 4 * (0.5 + 0.5 * sin(u * tau * 30 - t * 4))"
      }
    },
    {
